!Name: ships-c4d-through-glider
!C This collection consists of interactions between two spaceships
!C where the interaction takes place between the leading spaceship
!C and a glider or glider-like component of the trailing spaceship
!C (that is, the ships are connected "through a glider").
!C Cases where the trailing spaceship is simply a glider are not
!C included here, but can be found in ships-c4d-small.rle
!C
!C This collection was compiled by Nicolay Beluchenko.
!C
